
---

## ⚙️ `.env.example` (pulito, PA-ready)

```env
APP_NAME=Archivium
APP_ENV=production
APP_KEY=
APP_DEBUG=false
APP_URL=https://comune-nome.archivium.cloud

LOG_CHANNEL=stack
LOG_LEVEL=info

# Database
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=archivium
DB_USERNAME=archivium
DB_PASSWORD=secret

# Session / Cache
SESSION_DRIVER=database
CACHE_DRIVER=database

# Filesystem
FILESYSTEM_DISK=local

# Mail (placeholder, opzionale)
MAIL_MAILER=log
MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=archivium@archivium.cloud
MAIL_FROM_NAME="Archivium"

# Filament
FILAMENT_PATH=admin
